      "content": "\"letting go of the fight\"... that sounds nice, but how do you actually do that? it feels like i'm just stuck in this loop of being angry and tired and knowing that no matter what i do, the people who did this are just going to keep winning. there's no way to win against something this big. everything i built is just gone. there's nothing left for me here.",
